{"id":"habituel","lemma":"habituel","pos":"adj","rank":3962,"glosses":["customary, habitual"],"ipa":"/a.bi.tɥɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6f/Fr-habituel.ogg/Fr-habituel.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"habituelle","masculinePlural":"habituels","femininePlural":"habituelles"},"formAudio":{"habituelle":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-habituelle.wav","habituels":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Roptat-habituels.wav","habituelles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-habituelles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il a dû rater son train habituel.","en":"He must have missed his usual train.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to miss"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"train"},null]},{"text":"C'étaient des jeunes gens habituels.","en":"They're typical young people.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"young people"]]},{"text":"Il peut avoir manqué son bus habituel.","en":"He may have missed his usual bus.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"missed"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"bus"},null]},{"text":"C'est la procédure habituelle.","en":"It's standard procedure.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"procedure"},null]},{"text":"Nous nous verrons à l'endroit habituel.","en":"We'll meet at the usual place.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"place, spot"},null]}]}